WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.140
One point two seven three trillion dollars.

00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:10.306
That is the projected MAID savings by 2047 — from the Parliamentary Budget Officer's own report, October 2020.

00:00:10.306 --> 00:00:14.318
One hundred and forty-nine million in annual healthcare savings.

00:00:14.318 --> 00:00:17.045
Every MAID death saves the government money.

00:00:17.045 --> 00:00:18.988
That is not a theory.

00:00:18.988 --> 00:00:21.454
That is the government's own math.

00:00:21.454 --> 00:00:27.068
Prime Minister Carney holds six point eight million dollars in Brookfield Asset Management options.

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:31.931
Brookfield pitched a fifty-billion-dollar Maple Fund in September 2024.

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:34.284
Carney became Prime Minister.

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:39.784
In April 2026, the government launched a fifty-one-billion-dollar infrastructure fund.

00:00:39.784 --> 00:00:47.715
BlackRock holds three hundred and eight million in Brookfield shares — a thirteen hundred and seventy-three percent increase since 2023.

00:00:47.715 --> 00:00:53.840
Nine point three nine three billion dollars wasted in just two projects — Phoenix Pay and ArriveCAN.

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:59.829
Fifty-six percent of MPs lobbied by CIJA across five hundred and seventy-nine instances.

00:00:59.829 --> 00:01:03.784
The fiscal pipeline has a source, a route, and a destination.

00:01:03.784 --> 00:01:06.363
This page shows you all three.
